     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{24}}{{\\sqrt {15} }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply the numerator and denominator by <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {15} \"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{24 \\times \\sqrt {15} }}{{\\sqrt {15}  \\times \\sqrt {15} }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Simplify.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{24\\sqrt {15} }}{{15}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Divide out 3.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{8\\sqrt {15} }}{5}\"></span></p>"
