     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11\\sqrt {14} }}{{6\\sqrt {21} }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply the numerator and denominator by <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {21} \"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11\\sqrt {14}  \\times \\sqrt {21} }}{{6\\sqrt {21}  \\times \\sqrt {21} }}\"></span></p>\n<p>Simplify.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11\\sqrt {14 \\times 21} }}{{6 \\times 21}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Divide out 3.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11\\sqrt {49} \\sqrt 6 }}{{6 \\times 21}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11 \\times \\cancel{7}\\sqrt 6 }}{{6 \\times \\cancel{7} \\times 3}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{11\\sqrt 6 }}{{18}}\"></span></p>"
